  "new_exact_all_temperature_theorem": "Both the old and gap-optimized 15-edge Z2 pi-flux patterns have det(I+t B B\u2020) coefficientwise >= the TOE61 (1,1,1) three-pi deck sector, with strict positivity in 37 coefficients for t>0. By the same Weierstrass cosh product proof used in TOE61, their half-filled free fermion free energies are STRICTLY LOWER than the three-pi sector for EVERY finite beta>0. This explicitly refutes extension of TOE61's eight-sector minimization to the unrestricted link-Z2 gauge configuration space.",
